{"seq":9,"slug":"deep-earth-science","title":"深地科学与工程","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"深地科学与工程-简介\">深地科学与工程 简介</h1><p>深地科学与工程是面向地球深部资源开发、空间利用与灾害防控的新兴交叉学科，2026年由中国矿业大学率先获批设立本科专业。该学科融合岩体力学、地下工程、能源储存和智能运维等方向，致力于培养能够解决千米级深地空间开发关键技术问题的复合型工程人才。</p>\n<p>随着浅层资源日趋枯竭，人类活动不断向地球深部延伸。深地空间不仅蕴藏丰富的矿产与地热资源，还为大规模储能、战略物资储备和科学试验提供了独特的环境条件。当前我国深地工程领域人才缺口超过12万人，且以每年15%的速度递增，行业对系统掌握深地科学理论与工程技术的专业人员需求极为迫切。</p>\n<p>本教程面向深地科学与工程专业本科生及相关方向研究生，同时适合从事矿山工程、隧道工程和地下空间开发的工程技术人员参考学习。</p>\n<p>全书共分四章，依照&quot;认知基础—建造技术—功能利用—运维管理&quot;的逻辑递进：</p>\n<p><strong>第一章 深部岩体力学与地质工程</strong>系统讲解深部高应力环境下岩体的力学行为、地质灾害预警及冲击动力学，为后续工程实践奠定理论根基。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章 深地工程智能建造</strong>聚焦千米级深地空间的施工方法，涵盖竖井与巷道施工、装配式建造、TBM与盾构等智能化掘进技术。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章 深地空间储能利用</strong>介绍利用深地空间进行重力储能、压缩气体储能和氢能地下储存的原理与关键技术，展望新型能源体系下深地空间的战略价值。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章 智能运维与前沿</strong>探讨深地极端环境传感与物联网、数字孪生监测以及AI预测性维护，呈现深地工程智能化运维的前沿方向。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先修完第一章建立力学与地质认知基础，再依次学习第二、三章的工程技术内容，最后通过第四章了解智能运维与学科前沿。学习过程中应结合深地工程智能建造与健康运维全国重点实验室的试验案例，加深对理论知识的实践理解。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rock-mechanics-geotechnics","title":"深部岩体力学与地质工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/rock-mechanics-geotechnics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deep-rock-mechanics","title":"深部岩体力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/rock-mechanics-geotechnics/deep-rock-mechanics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"geotechnical-engineering","title":"深地地质工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/rock-mechanics-geotechnics/geotechnical-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dynamic-impact-mechanics","title":"冲击动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/rock-mechanics-geotechnics/dynamic-impact-mechanics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"intelligent-construction","title":"深地工程智能建造","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/intelligent-construction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"underground-construction-tech","title":"深地工程施工技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/intelligent-construction/underground-construction-tech"},{"seq":2,"slug":"assembly-construction","title":"装配式施工技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/intelligent-construction/assembly-construction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tbm-shield-tunneling","title":"TBM 与盾构技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/intelligent-construction/tbm-shield-tunneling"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"underground-storage","title":"深地空间储能利用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/underground-storage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gravity-energy-storage","title":"重力储能技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/underground-storage/gravity-energy-storage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compressed-gas-storage","title":"压缩气体储能","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/underground-storage/compressed-gas-storage"},{"seq":3,"slug":"underground-hydrogen-storage","title":"地下氢能存储","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/underground-storage/underground-hydrogen-storage"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"smart-operations-frontiers","title":"智能运维与前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/smart-operations-frontiers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sensors-and-iot","title":"深地传感与物联网","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/smart-operations-frontiers/sensors-and-iot"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-twin-monitoring","title":"数字孪生与健康监测","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/smart-operations-frontiers/digital-twin-monitoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-predictive-maintenance","title":"AI 预测性维护","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/deep-earth-science/smart-operations-frontiers/ai-predictive-maintenance"}]}]}